message:
Half way done with compile_to_hardware.

Many issues sorted out along the way. We now assume that Qubit2ChannelMap.json
has fields for each awg that specify the AWG type. E.g.
"TekAWG": {
	"type": "Tek5000"
},
"BBNAPS1": {
	"type": "BBNAPS"
}
...

--BRJ and CAR

Updates the sensor: UAVSAR_HDF5_SLC
- fixes issues with reference UTC (when it includes microseconds);
- updates cast from complex32 to complex64 (some versions require complex64 casting through a "sink" - with statement).
